ki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to Y\">\\(f:X\\to Y\\)</span> (measurable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\mathcal T\">\\(\\Sigma,\\mathcal T\\)</span> (source and target sigma-algebras)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> (pushforward measure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> (measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10PushforwardMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10PushforwardMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对函数图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 与集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}\">\\(f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}\\)</span>；函数图及定义域使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}pushforward\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10PushforwardMeasure}_S(\\nu,\\mu,f,X,\\Sigma,Y,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal T\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathcal T)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal T\\;(\\nu(B)=\\mu(f^{-1}[B]))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}pushforward\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10PushforwardMeasure}_S(\\nu,\\mu,f,X,\\Sigma,Y,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal T\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathcal T)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal T\\;(\\nu(B)=\\mu(f^{-1}[B]))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary pushforward measure definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved"